WEBVTT

00:09:58.093 --> 00:10:00.471
and a game that can continue
to inspire them

00:10:00.512 --> 00:10:03.974
into what is possible
for them in the future.

00:10:03.974 --> 00:10:06.685
And also, we are committed
to continue building this game

00:10:06.685 --> 00:10:09.980
into a game that we shall be able to make
available to other children

00:10:10.022 --> 00:10:11.857
in other refugee camps across Uganda

00:10:11.899 --> 00:10:14.610
and other countries
across the African continent.

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:16.278
In the past one year,

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:19.990
about 100 million people across
the world have been displaced,

00:10:20.032 --> 00:10:22.785
and many of these
are the result of a civil war.

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:26.580
From Kyangwali refugee camp
in western Uganda

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:27.748
to New York City

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:31.043
and standing in front of you today
and engaging with you